---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout title="About | Justin Ho">
  <section class="about-page">
    <div class="about-hero">
      <img
        src="/images/photography/justin-ho.jpg"
        alt="Justin Ho"
        class="profile-photo"
      />

      <div class="about-intro">
        <h1>About Justin</h1>

        <p>
          I'm Justin Ho, a Singapore-based editor, director and visual storyteller with more than a decade of experience creating branded content, documentaries and commercial campaigns. My work spans commercials, corporate films, documentaries and digital content, with projects delivered across cinema, broadcast and social media platforms.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p>
      I graduated with a degree in Multimedia Design and have spent more than a
      decade working in video production, post-production and content creation.
      Throughout my career, I've had the opportunity to work on branded content,
      corporate films, documentaries and digital campaigns for a wide range of
      clients and organisations.
    </p>
    <figure class="behind-the-scenes-block">
      <img
        src="/images/about/justin-directing-1600.jpg"
        alt="Justin directing on set"
        class="behind-the-scenes"
      />
      <figcaption>
        Reviewing footage with the client while shaping the narrative direction of the film.
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <p>
      What I enjoy most is finding the story hidden within the material. Whether
      I'm shaping hours of footage into a concise narrative, capturing moments
      behind the camera, or creating photographs that preserve a memory, I'm
      always looking for the human element that makes a story worth telling.
    </p>

    <p>
      Outside of media, I am also the founder of Lifegate, a Chinese Metaphysics
      consultancy focused on helping people navigate career decisions, business
      challenges and life transitions. While Lifegate is a separate venture, the
      same principle drives both sides of my work: helping people find clarity,
      direction and meaning through better stories.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you'd like to collaborate on a project, I'd love to hear from you.
    </p>
  </section>

  <style>
    .about-page {
      max-width: 920px;
    }

    .about-hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 260px 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: end;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .profile-photo {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 16px;
    }

    .about-intro p {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .behind-the-scenes-block {
      margin: 40px 0;
    }

    .behind-the-scenes {
      width: 100%;
      border-radius: 16px;
      display: block;
    }

    figcaption {
      margin-top: 6px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-style: italic;
      line-height: 1.4;
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .about-hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 32px;
        align-items: start;
      }

      .profile-photo {
        max-width: 320px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</MainLayout>